token AT rsp : 'Dr'
scored tokens: ". Emily Johnson had always been drawn to helping others. As a child, she would listen intently to her friends' problems and offer words of comfort and advice. It was no surprise, then, that she eventually pursued a career in therapy.\n\nAfter years of studying and gaining experience, Dr. Johnson opened her own private practice in a cozy office in the heart of the city. Her clients came from all walks of life, each with their own unique struggles and challenges. Some were dealing with anxiety or depression, while others were struggling with relationships or work-related stress.\n\nDespite the variety of issues she encountered, Dr. Johnson approached each session with the same level of compassion and empathy. She believed that everyone deserved to be heard and understood, and she made it her mission to create a safe and non-judgmental space for her clients to share their thoughts and feelings.\n\nOne of Dr. Johnson's most challenging cases was a young woman named Sarah, who had experienced a traumatic event that left her struggling with PTSD. At first, Sarah was hesitant to open up, but Dr. Johnson's gentle demeanor and unwavering support gradually helped her to trust and confide in her therapist.\n\nOver time, Sarah began to make progress, learning coping mechanisms and strategies to manage her symptoms<|im_end|>\n"
